  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3208.04 Treatment of Banked Allowances. Any allowances banked on or after January 1, 2012 shall be retired at the end of 3 years after their designated year of allocation.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
